    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>SPOOCKEY</strong> is an arcade game that combines the block breaker game genre with the pace and feel of real life air hockey and some forbidden magics to create quick, thrilling PvP matches where nothing is set in stone until the very end.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> PvP air hockey-like gameplay with paddles and teleports<br></li><li> Compete online against randos with matchmaking<br></li><li> Challenge your friends from lobbies<br></li><li> It turns any day into Halloween (careful with that hot PSL!)<br></li><li> more coming in future updates...</li></ul><br><i>Keep an eye out and keep a cool head because it's air hockey, it's spooky... it's SPOOCKEY!!</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/916480/extras/b65702b179370ef3929f95faf50b4946.avif?t=1663596921\" /></div>",
